?), W.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "often w.r. for भट", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "भट्ट mf(आ)n. venerable, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["भट्टः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["BawwaH"]}, {"id": "BawwA", "headword": "भट्टा", "headword_slp1": "BawwA", "fold": "Bawa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "भट्टा f. N. of an enchantress, Rājat.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "BAwa", "headword": "भाट", "headword_slp1": "BAwa", "fold": "Bawa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "भाट m. or n. (√ भट्) wages, hire, rent, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["भाटं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["BAwaM"]}, {"id": "BAwwa", "headword": "भाट्ट", "headword_slp1": "BAwwa", "fold": "Bawa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "भाट्ट m. a follower of Bhaṭṭa (i.e. Kumārila-bh˚), Vedāntas.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "pl. N. of a people, Rājat.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "भाट्ट n. the work of Bh˚, Pratāp., Sch.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["भाट्टः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["BAwwaH"]}], "Bawadipika": [{"id": "BawadIpikA", "headword": "भटदीपिका", "headword_slp1": "BawadIpikA", "fold": "Bawadipika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "भट—दीपिका f. N. of a Comm. on Ārya-bhaṭa.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "BawwadIpikA", "headword": "भट्टदीपिका", "headword_slp1": "BawwadIpikA", "fold": "Bawadipika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "भट्ट—दीपिका f. N. of wk. (cf. भट-द्˚).", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "BAwwadIpikA", "headword": "भाट्टदीपिका", "headword_slp1": "BAwwadIpikA", "fold": "Bawadipika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "भाट्ट—दीपिका f. N. of wk.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "Bawapewaka": [{"id": "Bawapewaka", "headword": "भटपेटक", "headword_slp1": "Bawapewaka", "fold": "Bawapewaka", "headword_language":